        </div>

        <div class="lesson-list">
          <article class="lesson-row reveal"><span class="lesson-no">01</span><h3>Small Classes</h3><p>A supportive class environment with more opportunity for individual attention and focused teaching.</p><span class="arrow">↗</span></article>
          <article class="lesson-row reveal"><span class="lesson-no">02</span><h3>Sibling Lessons</h3><p>A convenient option for siblings who can build confidence and learn together in the same supportive environment.</p><span class="arrow">↗</span></article>
