      </div>
    </div>
    <section class="section soft" id="why">
      <div class="flow-wave flow-wave-top" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 1600 220" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <path class="flow-wave-soft" d="M-120 118 C100 35 290 188 520 112 C770 30 930 176 1185 104 C1390 46 1510 72 1720 120"></path>
          <path class="flow-wave-main" d="M-140 148 C95 72 300 205 545 139 C790 74 960 198 1210 132 C1415 80 1550 94 1730 144"></path>
          <path class="flow-wave-highlight" d="M-100 86 C115 20 310 154 535 83 C770 8 960 157 1200 87 C1410 28 1545 54 1710 96"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="wrap why-grid">
        <div class="why-photo reveal why-photo-visible">
          <img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="A swimmer practising in the water during a Swimtrain lesson" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="kicker">Why Swimtrain</span>
          <h2>Less pressure. <span class="pink">More attention.</span></h2>
          <p class="body">Lessons are specialised around individual needs, creating a more focused learning experience where swimmers can build confidence and progress at a pace that suits them.</p>

          <div class="benefits">
            <div class="benefit"><b>01</b><strong>More individual attention</strong><span>Smaller and 1-to-1 formats create more room to focus on the swimmer.</span></div>
            <div class="benefit"><b>02</b><strong>Adapted teaching</strong><span>Lessons can respond to ability, confidence and individual needs.</span></div>
            <div class="benefit"><b>03</b><strong>Calmer environment</strong><span>A private pool offers a different experience from a busy public leisure centre.</span></div>
            <div class="benefit"><b>04</b><strong>Progress parents can follow</strong><span>The online portal helps families keep up with their child's swimming journey.</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section pool-section" id="pool">
      <div class="flow-wave flow-wave-top" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 1600 220" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <path class="flow-wave-soft" d="M-120 118 C100 35 290 188 520 112 C770 30 930 176 1185 104 C1390 46 1510 72 1720 120"></path>
          <path class="flow-wave-main" d="M-140 148 C95 72 300 205 545 139 C790 74 960 198 1210 132 C1415 80 1550 94 1730 144"></path>
          <path class="flow-wave-highlight" d="M-100 86 C115 20 310 154 535 83 C770 8 960 157 1200 87 C1410 28 1545 54 1710 96"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="wrap pool-grid">
        <div class="pool-photo reveal">
          <img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Swimtrain's private heated swimming pool in Boxmoor, Hemel Hempstead" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="kicker">Our private pool</span>

          
          <div class="temperature-water" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 700 150" preserveAspectRatio="none">
              <path class="temp-wave temp-wave-a" d="M-60 84 C55 32 135 120 245 77 C360 32 440 118 555 74 C615 51 660 56 760 86"></path>
              <path class="temp-wave temp-wave-b" d="M-65 111 C50 62 150 142 270 102 C385 63 470 139 585 101 C640 83 690 84 765 108"></path>
              <path class="temp-wave temp-wave-c" d="M-50 56 C55 14 140 94 250 50 C360 6 448 94 560 51 C620 28 665 33 750 61"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="temperature-stage" id="temperatureStage">
            <div class="thermometer" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="thermo-shell"><div class="thermo-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="thermo-bulb"></div>
              <div class="thermo-lines"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="temp-copy">
              <strong>32°C</strong>
              <span>Private heated pool</span>
              <small>The thermometer fills as you scroll into the pool section, finishing at Swimtrain's 32°C pool temperature.</small>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="body">A warm, private environment can make lessons feel more comfortable — particularly for babies, younger swimmers and anyone who prefers a calmer setting.</p>

